# Ignore the "current" working snapshot — that's the per-run output
# of `scripts/print-assumptions-snapshot`, which the diff against the
# checked-in `baseline/` is computed from. The baseline IS checked in
# so future drift is detectable; the current directory is recomputed
# locally on every run.
current/

# Driver compilation byproducts (the wrapper cleans these up on
# success but they may linger on error or partial runs).
*.vo
*.vok
*.vos
*.glob
